+void SdlEventSource::openOtherControllers() {
+	// All of them, not only joystick_num: the player uses whichever is in
+	// their hands. On a Steam Deck with an 8BitDo pad connected, SDL listed
+	// the 8BitDo first and the Deck's own controls did nothing (2026-10-14).
